<title>FINLAND: POSTIPANKKI TO LAUNCH TWO FIM 200 MLN BONDS.</title>
<headline>POSTIPANKKI TO LAUNCH TWO FIM 200 MLN BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned bank Postipankki Oy will offer two 200 million markka bonds, one three-year and one five-year bond, to the public, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-year bond has a 3.65 percent coupon and the issue price will be variable. The five-year paper's coupon is 4.35 percent and the issue price will be variable.</p>
<p>The subscribtion period runs from September 1 to October 31, Postipankki said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
